        "body": "Hut 8 Corp. is a Miami, Florida based public company traded under the ticker HUT. On its own site it describes itself as owning, operating, and scaling purpose-built businesses that acquire, deploy, and monetize specialized hardware for next-generation, energy-intensive technologies. Through that portfolio, the company says it provides direct exposure to markets created by transformative technologies such as AI and Bitcoin mining.\n\nThe site's most specific AI claim is about the Beacon Point AI data center campus. Hut 8 states it has fully commercialized the 1 GW campus with a second 352 MW IT lease, which it says brings campus-level base-term contract value to $19.6 billion. No individual AI products are tracked for the company, and no MCP servers are listed.\n\nThe company's profile records a CIK of 0001964789 and a headquarters in Miami, FL. Litigation data associates it with 68 cases in Florida, and no lawsuits are otherwise listed.",
